# Every brightness change sends a uevent, and Steam's dimming and slider send
# a lot of them. With the systemd tag each one becomes a D-Bus signal, which
# makes Wine's mount manager re-read every UFS partition (96 on this phone)
# from udisksd in every Proton game. Nothing here needs systemd to track
# backlights: gamescope and KDE write the brightness through sysfs. Named to
# sort after 99-systemd.rules. (Same as the 8 Gen 2 image.)
SUBSYSTEM=="backlight", TAG-="systemd"
